# Environment Variables for Portfolio Backend

# Email Configuration
EMAIL_ADDRESS=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASSWORD=your-app-password
RECIPIENT_EMAIL=your-email@gmail.com

# SMTP Configuration (Gmail)
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace the values with your actual email credentials
# 3. For Gmail, use an App Password instead of your regular password
# 4. Make sure to enable 2-factor authentication and generate an App Password
